{"abstract":[{"text":"The Kemeny constant: the expected number of steps of the random walk (edge weights as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition rates, a loop taken with probability 2w\/d(v)) from a vertex to a target drawn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the stationary distribution, which does not depend on the start; Σ_{i≥2} 1\/μᵢ over the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalized Laplacian spectrum. nil when the graph is not connected, 0 for zero or one vertex.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"NetworkX ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kemeny_constant"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/kemenyConstant(weight:)-4bx2c"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/kemenyconstant(weight:)-4bx2c"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P08SpectralA6TheoryE14kemenyConstant6weightSdSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_tSBRd__lF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"kemenyConstant(weight:)","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"SpectralGraphTheory"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kemenyConstant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text